></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bdE6DJ58HG9AB3vtpF0C9aF9ORevC28KVXDcOcVMkG3kPvQVbKUPHP4GZuS4CKlGHQtRnAKD1iaVqrtfATye21g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>2025</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>一、学校简介</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>北京林业大学是教育部直属、教育部与国家林业和草原局共建的全国重点大学，是国家首批“211工程”重点建设高校和国家“优势学科创新平台”建设项目试点高校，是国家“双一流”建设高校。作为首批入驻雄安新区的四所高校之一，2024年，雄安校区开工建设，加快构建“一校两区一园”新发展格局。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bdE6DJ58HG9AB3vtpF0C9aF9ORevC28KVXDcOcVMkG3kPvQVbKUPHP4GZuS4CKlGHQtRnAKD1iaVqrtfATye21g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bdE6DJ58HG9AB3vtpF0C9aF9ORevC28KVXDcOcVMkG3kPvQVbKUPHP4GZuS4CKlGHQtRnAKD1iaVqrtfATye21g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>2025</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>二、学院简介</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>生物科学与技术学院是基于国家生物科学理科基础研究与教学人才培养基地，于1997年组建成立的基础科学研究与教学型学院。学院以培养生物科学、生物技术、食品科学领域基础研究人才和高新技术人才为主要目标，2021年入选国家基础学科生物科学拔尖学生培养计划2.0基地。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院下设植物科学系、动物科学与微生物学系、生物化学与分子生物学系、生物技术系和食品科学与工程系，设有生物科学（国家拔尖计划2.0 基地班与国家理科基地班）、生物技术、食品科学与工程3个本科专业以及1个北京林业大学-加拿大不列颠哥伦比亚大学（UBC）生物技术专业国际合作办学项目。建有生物学和林学博士后流动站；拥有生物学一级学科博士点，下设植物学、微生物学、细胞生物学、生物化学与分子生物学、计算生物学与生物信息学、森林生物资源利用等6个博士点二级学科和遗传学、动物学2个硕士点二级学科，另设林学国家级重点学科林木遗传育种博士点二级学科以及林业硕士专业学位授权点；新增林业专业博士学位授权点1个。学院拥有食品科学与工程一级硕士学位授予权、农业硕士“食品加工与安全”专业硕士学位授予权，以及“森林生物资源利用”二级学科博士点，新增生物与医药、食品与营养2个专业硕士学位授权点。其中植物学、林木遗传育种学2个学科为国家级重点学科。2023年，植物与动物学科入选ESI世界学科排名前1‰，生物学与生物化学入选ESI世界学科排名前1%。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bdE6DJ58HG9AB3vtpF0C9aF9ORevC28KVXDcOcVMkG3kPvQVbKUPHP4GZuS4CKlGHQtRnAKD1iaVqrtfATye21g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bdE6DJ58HG9AB3vtpF0C9aF9ORevC28KVXDcOcVMkG3kPvQVbKUPHP4GZuS4CKlGHQtRnAKD1iaVqrtfATye21g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>2025</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>三、招生专业</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（一）学术学位硕士</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.生物学（理学）：植物学、动物学、微生物学、遗传学、细胞生物学、生物化学与分子生物学、计算生物学与生物信息学</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.林学（农学）：林木遗传育种</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.食品科学与工程（工学）</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>（二）专业学位硕士</span></span></p><p><span><span>生物与医药，食品与营养、林业</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bdE6DJ58HG9AB3vtpF0C9aF9ORevC28KVXDcOcVMkG3kPvQVbKUPHP4GZuS4CKlGHQtRnAKD1iaVqrtfATye21g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bdE6DJ58HG9AB3vtpF0C9aF9ORevC28KVXDcOcVMkG3kPvQVbKUPHP4GZuS4CKlGHQtRnAKD1iaVqrtfATye21g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>2025</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>四、招生对象</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>生物学、林学、食品等相关领域，有志于攻读我院研究生的全国高等院校2026届应届本科毕业生。具体条件如下：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.遵守宪法和法律，拥护中国共产党的领导和社会主义制度。具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，诚实守信，学风端正，品行优良，无考试作弊或剽窃他人学术成果等学术不端行为。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.积极向上，热爱生活，身心健康，能够较好地完成日常学习、生活和人际交往。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.学习成绩优秀，本科前三年综合成绩排名在本专业前40%（本科期间获得与学科专业相关的国家级竞赛者成绩要求可以适当放宽）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.对生物学、林学、食品等领域有强烈兴趣，有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的科学研究能力或潜力。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检标准。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bdE6DJ58HG9AB3vtpF0C9aF9ORevC28KVXDcOcVMkG3kPvQVbKUPHP4GZuS4CKlGHQtRnAKD1iaVqrtfATye21g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bdE6DJ58HG9AB3vtpF0C9aF9ORevC28KVXDcOcVMkG3kPvQVbKUPHP4GZuS4CKlGHQtRnAKD1iaVqrtfATye21g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>2025</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>五、报名事项</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>报名截止时间：</span></span><strong><span><span>6月26日（周四）下午17:00</span></span></strong><span><span>，逾期报名或材料不符合要求视为报名无效，需</span></span><strong><span><span>发送材料并填写信息登记表</span></span></strong><span><span>。（每位同学只能申报一个专业）</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.《北京林业大学生物科学与技术学院2025年暑期夏令营申请表》（填写完成并签字后扫描为PDF）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.本科成绩单及专业排名证明（PDF扫描件）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.申请表上填写的相关成果证明材料（如已发表论文的复印件、各类证书等）（PDF扫描件）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>将上述三项材料放入一个文件夹中，将整个文件夹压缩后发送至邮箱，压缩包和邮件主题均命名为“夏令营申请-申请（学科）专业-姓名-本科院校名”，发送至邮箱swyanhui@163.com，并填写信息登记链接进行登记。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>北京林业大学生物科学与技术学院2025年大学生暑期夏令营信息登记表</span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>学院将会对报名者的资格进行审核，审核通过名单预计于7月初在生物学院网站（http://biology.bjfu.edu.cn/）公布。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bdE6DJ58HG9AB3vtpF0C9aF9ORevC28KVXDcOcVMkG3kPvQVbKUPHP4GZuS4CKlGHQtRnAKD1iaVqrtfATye21g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bdE6DJ58HG9AB3vtpF0C9aF9ORevC28KVXDcOcVMkG3kPvQVbKUPHP4GZuS4CKlGHQtRnAKD1iaVqrtfATye21g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>2025</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>六、举办形式</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>此次夏令营不收取任何费用，采取“线上+线下”相结合的形式举办。</span></span></p><p><span><span>线下参会交通、食宿费用自理，鼓励有条件的同学线下参会，可充分了解学院并与专家及导师面对面交流。线上采用“腾讯会议”作为交流平台，请线上参会的营员提前下载安装会议APP。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bdE6DJ58HG9AB3vtpF0C9aF9ORevC28KVXDcOcVMkG3kPvQVbKUPHP4GZuS4CKlGHQtRnAKD1iaVqrtfATye21g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bdE6DJ58HG9AB3vtpF0C9aF9ORevC28KVXDcOcVMkG3kPvQVbKUP